              ]
            },
            "row-13": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What is 5-ply titanium construction?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-1": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Our pans are engineered with 5 bonded layers for unmatched performance: Inner surface: certified pure titanium with SlipScale™ non-stick pattern. Core: 3 layers of high-conductivity aluminum for fast, even heating. Exterior: Stainless steel shell for durability, induction compatibility, and warp resistance. This combination delivers safety, speed, and strength in one pan.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "1rem",
                    "line_height": "normal",
