              },
              "blocks": {
                "text-1": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Many steel cubes are made from mixed metals that can corrode, rust, or leave a harsh aftertaste in more delicate drinks like wine or cocktails. They’re also heavier and are not food-safe.</p>",
